ATTHARA BHAIYO KI BEHAN QAID HUWI HAI,<br>
PARDES ME ZAINAB PA QAYAMAT KI GHADI HAI.<br>
<br>
1.HUMRAHA MUHAFIZ THE AMARI THI RIDA THI,<br>
YASRIB SE BASADD SHAAN CHALI JISKI SAWARI,<br>
BE AASRA MQATAL SE WOHI BIBI CHALI HAI.<br>
ATTHARA BHAIYO..................................<br>
<br>
2.ROTA HAI TADAP TA HAI DIL E ABID E MUZTAR,<br>
GIRJAATA HAI SAR GHAZI KA NAIZE SE ZAMI PAR,<br>
RASSI JO NABI ZAADI KE HAATHAU ME BANDHI HAI.<br>
ATTHARA BHAIYO..................................<br>
<br>
3.IMDAD KO SHAHZADI BHALA KISKO PUKARE,<br>
ISLAM PE QURBAAN HUWE SAARE SAHARE,<br>
PARDES ME MAJBOOR BOHAT BINTE ALI HAI.<br>
ATTHARA BHAIYO...................................<br>
<br>
4.WO JISKO ANDHERE NE BHI DEKHA NA KHULE SAR,<br>
LAYE HAI USEY DIN KE UJALE ME SITAMGAR,<br>
CHADAR BHI NAHI SAR PE GAREEBUL WATANI HAI.<br>
ATTHARA BHAIYO....................................<br>
<br>
5.JAB SHUMR SAKINA KO LAGATA HAI TAMACHE,<br>
USWAQT SADA DETI HAI ZAINAB YAHI ROKE,<br>
ZALIM MEREI BACHI BADE NAZAU KI PALI HAI.<br>
ATTHARA BHAIYO....................................<br>
<br>
6.SHEHZADIYAA HAR GAAM PE KEHTI HAI TADAP KAR,<br>
HUM AALE MOHD HAII YUN BARSAO NA PATTHER,<br>
AUR SAARE SITAMGAARAU KE HOTAU PE HASI HAI.<br>
ATTHARA BHAIYO...................................<br>
<br>
7.DARBAR ME EK AUR QAYAMAT HUWI BARPA,<br>
DIL DOOZ E NAZARA THA JO ZAINAB NE HAI DEKHA,<br>
BHAI KA SAR HAI AUR SITAMGER KI CHADI HAI.<br>
ATTHARA BHAIYO.....................................